    onto:isProvidedBy <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hyzon_Motors> ;
    onto:usesProduct <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Proton-exchange_membrane_fuel_cell> ;
    onto:usesTechnology onto:Hyzon_hybrid_bi-polar_plate_technology ;
    skos:definition "Long Haul Truck manufactured by Hyzon Motors having a driving range up to 500 miles. Power: 450 kW/603 hp peak/ 15 minute refueling time"@en .

onto:HyzonHymaxSeries a onto:LongHaulTruck,
